    "body": "Cancelling every certificate error made device web interfaces that use self-signed certificates inaccessible. This revision adds an Advanced Settings toggle that defaults to rejecting every certificate error, while allowing users who need self-signed device interfaces to explicitly restore the previous behavior of accepting all such errors.\n\nThe WebView client reads the setting for each certificate error, so the existing WebView certificate validation behavior remains in use by default and changes to the setting take effect without recreating the client.",
